  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow->>SDD_SEQ_05_DB: save authored version
  SDD_SEQ_05_Expert->>SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow: submit exact completed version
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow->>SDD_SEQ_05_DB: record submission
  SDD_SEQ_05_LD->>SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow: review submitted version
  alt revision requested
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow->>SDD_SEQ_05_DB: return with actual reviewer/time/feedback
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow-->>SDD_SEQ_05_Expert: revision required
  else publication approved
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow->>SDD_SEQ_05_DB: record decision/publication + durable event
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow->>SDD_SEQ_05_Graph: apply versioned authorized projection
  SDD_SEQ_05_Workflow-->>SDD_SEQ_05_LD: available Role-Level projection or explicit failure
